{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>From Bozrah</b> — two instances in the Masorah; one is חמוץ בגדים מבצרה. In the time to come Bozrah will be smitten together with Edom, because she established a king for them — she crowned them. And this is חמוץ בגדים מבצרה — Bozrah will be smitten, as stated: \"Jobab son of Zerah, from Bozrah.\""], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:46.361385561Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}